  "prefLabel": "He-P 308.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 308.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to set forth the procedures for administration and distribution of funds directed toward mosquito control activities as established in RSA 141-C:25 and establishment of mosquito control districts.\n\nSource. #8683, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 7-17-06, EXPIRED: 1-13-07\n\nNew. #8799, eff 1-19-07; ss by #9173, eff 6-7-08, EXPIRED: 6-7-16",
